{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:da4e2621bc8ff060","name":"Force Traditions","source":{"id":"source:reference-da4e2621bc8ff060","title":"Force Traditions","revision":26163,"timestamp":"2025-02-12T04:31:20Z","sha256":"1bbd3d73f71e1aa434e469d8d232b84bfb0bf29fc9f1a79eb1a8c99116d502d4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26163","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Force%20Traditions&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-da4e2621bc8ff060","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Even those who don't believe in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," and aren't particularly attuned to its flow can call upon ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," without understanding exactly what they are doing. When a stroke of luck occurs, or fate seems to be on your side and helps you accomplish a difficult objective, it could be ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," coming to your aid. In game terms, the expenditure of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"}," by non-Force-using characters represents this unconscious, tenuous connection to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," that all living things share. When a Force-using character calls on ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," this way, he or she knows exactly what's happening.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The most prominent and well-known Force-users in the galaxy are ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},". However, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," are not the only ones who have learned to manipulate ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". Other Force-users sometimes attribute their abilities to sources other than ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", such as magic or gods, but they are all using the energy to manipulate the world around them. In game terms, anyone with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"}," feat has the ability to master the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill and learn ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"},", though many of these beings will never go down this particular path.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Other Force Traditions include Dark Side cults (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},"), and obscure, isolated sects such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Witches of Dathomir"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Witches_of_Dathomir","referenceId":"reference:967d8c890fd22a13"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sorcerers of Tund"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sorcerers_of_Tund","referenceId":"reference:b276fef09ae4628b"},". Some know ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," for what it is but approach its use in a different way from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},". Others know ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," by a different name. Either way, it remains the mystic energy that binds the galaxy together and gives Force-users their powers.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Membership:"]}," The conditions for being considered a member of a given Force Tradition are outlined in the description. A character may be a member of more than one Force Tradition, but this is uncommon.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Force Traditions"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["FORCE TRADITION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["REQUIREMENTS\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["N/A\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["N/A\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"},"; Varies by ",{"tag":"a","children":